{"id":"n64993-1-9","stage":2,"title":"숙박비 · 住宿费","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64993-1-9-1","ko":"여기는 하루 숙박비가 얼마나 되나요?","zh":"这里一天的住宿费是多少？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숙박비가","meaning":"住宿费","explanation":"숙박비：住宿费；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"숙박비","audio":"/audio/b844d31fad2e109ede08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64993","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙박비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"为","explanation":"되다：为；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"b844d31fad2e109e","term":"숙박비","zh":"住宿费","audio":"/audio/b844d31fad2e109ede08.mp3","entryId":"64993","definition":"在旅馆或酒店等睡觉停留花的费用。","pronunciation":["숙빡삐"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个对象的数量、费用等是多少，或地点是什么地方。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8094e8c5fc89a673128e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64993-1-9-2","ko":"요즘은 휴가철이라 십만 원은 주셔야 합니다.","zh":"现在是度假旺季，得付十万韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휴가철이라","meaning":"休假季，休假期","explanation":"휴가철：休假季，休假期；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"휴가철","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88405","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"십만","meaning":"十；万","explanation":"십：十；만：万","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"},{"term":"만","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"64558","senseId":"1","lemma":"만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원은","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셔야","meaning":"给","explanation":"주다：给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"9","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseI